===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er,more}}

# Full of liveliness and activity; characterized by quickness of motion or action.
#: {{syn|en|lively|spirited|quick|round}}
#: {{ux|en|We took a '''brisk''' walk yesterday.}}
#* {{RQ:Guardian|date=December 29, 2012
|author=Paul Doyle
|title=Arsenal's {{w|Theo Walcott}} hits hat-trick in thrilling victory over Newcastle
|url=http://www.guardian.co.uk/football/2012/dec/29/arsenal-newcastle-united-premier-league
|passage={{w|Demba Ba|Ba}}, who has been linked with a January move to Arsenal, should have rewarded their '''brisk''' start with the opening goal in the 16th minute.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20261013073237/https://www.theguardian.com/football/2012/dec/29/arsenal-newcastle-united-premier-league|archivedate=13 October 2026}}
